  (text "BLOCK 1: ESP32-S3 HAUPT-CONTROLLER\n- U1: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8 (16MB Flash, 8MB Octal PSRAM)\n- GPIO 1: ADC_BAT (USV LiPo)\n- GPIO 2: POD1_1WIRE_ID (DS2401 Port 1)\n- GPIO 3: ADC_LINE_LVL (Peak Sense)\n- GPIO 4: ADC_VIGN (KL15 1:11 Teiler)\n- GPIO 9..13: I2S Master Audio Bus (MCLK, BCLK, WS, DOUT, DIN)\n- GPIO 14/15: I2C Bus (BMI270 IMU & ES8388 Control)\n- GPIO 17/18: High-Speed UART (460.800 Baud zum Heck-Pod 3)\n- GPIO 19/20: TWAI CAN TX/RX\n- GPIO 21: GNSS_PPS (1-PPS Interrupt)\n- GPIO 22: POD2_1WIRE_ID (DS2401 Port 2)\n- GPIO 38/39: RESERVE_GPIO_A / B\n- GPIO 48: WS2812B RGB Status-LED" (at 25.4 130.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )

  (text "BLOCK 2: STEREO AUDIO-CODEC\n- U5: Everest ES8388 (24-Bit I2S DAC/ADC Master)\n- Line-In L/R <- Bourns Audio-Uebertrager T1/T2\n- Line-Out L/R -> Bourns Audio-Uebertrager T1/T2" (at 170.0 130.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )

  (text "BLOCK 3: CAN-BUS TRANSCEIVER & IMU\n- U6: TI TCAN334GDCNR (3.3V CAN-FD Transceiver, +-58V Fault Tolerance)\n- U4: Bosch Sensortec BMI270 (6-Achsen Gyro/Acc fuer 15-State EKF Schraeglagenfilterung)" (at 170.0 160.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )
)
